# Bits UI — docs before code

**Before** wiring Bits UI (props, `{#snippet child}`, `bind:ref`, floats, dates/locale): pull **LLM-oriented** docs so markup/API matches current Bits UI.

## Fetch order

1. **Component page** (replace `<slug>` with docs path segment, e.g. `dialog`, `popover`):  
   `https://www.bits-ui.com/docs/components/<slug>/llms.txt`
2. **Cross-cutting** (when snippet/ref/portal/theme applies):  
   - Child / DOM delegation: `https://www.bits-ui.com/docs/child-snippet/llms.txt`  
   - Refs: `https://www.bits-ui.com/docs/ref/llms.txt`  
   - Styling: `https://www.bits-ui.com/docs/styling/llms.txt`  
   - Floating content rules live under **Child Snippet** (wrapper `{...wrapperProps}` unstyled, inner `{...props}` styled).
3. **Bulk / discovery**: `https://www.bits-ui.com/docs/llms.txt` or index `https://www.bits-ui.com/llms.txt`.

Use **WebFetch** (or equivalent) on these URLs; do **not** guess portal structure or `child` signatures.

## After fetch

- Match **Bits UI** + **Svelte 5** runes (`$props`, snippets).
- For floating surfaces (`Popover.Content`, `Select.Content`, `Tooltip.Content`, etc.), enforce **two-level** `child` pattern from docs unless component API says otherwise.
